OL,3,AMPs call for investigation after
OL,4,ALutnick-Epstein whistleblower dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe treatment of whistleblowers by the
OL,7,FUK's financial watchdog must be
OL,8,Finvestigated following the death of a
OL,9,FBritish trader who exposed evidence of
OL,10,Flinks between US commerce secretary
OL,11,FHoward Lutnick and Jeffrey Epstein, MPs
OL,12,Fhave said.
OL,14,FSimon Andriesz, a former senior
OL,15,Femployee of BGC Partners - the
OL,16,Finternational firm of financial brokers
OL,17,Ffounded and run by Lutnick before his
OL,18,Fappointment by US President Donald
OL,19,FTrump - died last month in Thailand.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
PN,11907
SC,0007
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1791284168
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMPs call for investigation after
OL,4,ALutnick-Epstein whistleblower dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier this year, Andriesz raised
OL,7,Fconcerns with the Financial Conduct
OL,8,FAuthority (FCA), the FBI and other
OL,9,Fwatchdogs about evidence he had
OL,10,Funcovered of business links between
OL,11,FEpstein and Lutnick. It cast doubt on
OL,12,FLutnick's public statements about his
OL,13,Fassociations with the late sex
OL,14,Foffender.
OL,16,FA group of UK MPs have now said his
OL,17,Fdeath raises "deeply troubling
OL,18,Fquestions" about the way whistleblowers
OL,19,Fcan be treated when they approach the
OL,20,FFCA - the financial regulator - with
OL,21,Fconcerns about wrongdoing and
OL,22,Fsubsequent retaliation.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/38
