OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'Ghost particles' from space telescope
OL,4,Awins physics Nobel
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Royal Swedish Academy of Sciences
OL,7,Fsaid "his vision and scientific
OL,8,Fleadership have been fundamental for
OL,9,Fthe IceCube Neutrino Observatory".
OL,11,FHalzen first presented his vision for
OL,12,Fdetecting neutrinos at the South Pole
OL,13,Fin 1988.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/38
